'''Brains''' is a [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade features a brain inside of a shiny glass tube, hence the name. The guard and handle are solid black.

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]]. 
* It may reference Frankenstein's brain jar.{{UncommonsNav}}

